          "requiredFieldsRationale" = "Five fields are required, and the count is constrained by Salesforce, not by form design. CLM_Contract__c marks Contract_ID__c, Contract_Type__c, Counterparty__c, and Requester_Email__c as required, so their Form sources must be mandatory or the intake connector POST fails. contractPackage is required because the Box Agent, the approval task, and two connector fields all read the uploaded file. Do not relax any of these five without also changing the Salesforce object or removing the matching field from the connector body. Box substitutes the literal string 'Variable unavailable' for an unresolved variable, so an optional source silently corrupts a typed Salesforce field rather than arriving empty."
